WEBVTT

00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:17.000
Tencent Video presents

00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:29.920
Adapted from the bestseller The King's Avatar
by Butterfly Blue

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:32.270
Copyright Notice
All rights preserved by China Literature

00:00:56.060 --> 00:01:00.770
♪ The dawn piercing horn is being played by now ♪

00:01:00.770 --> 00:01:03.890
♪ Is that a fantasy or just past memories? ♪

00:01:05.930 --> 00:01:08.430
♪ Eyes wide open, but I can't tell ♪

00:01:09.270 --> 00:01:12.390
♪ which side of the road am I running on ♪

00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:19.770
♪ Would I know the memories and breaks mixed in morning light? ♪

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:23.140
♪ They said you shouldn't march on ♪

00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:25.640
♪ They said you have to say goodbye ♪

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:30.140
♪ They say you can have no tomorrow but dark night ♪

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:32.770
♪ Over the finish line ♪

00:01:32.770 --> 00:01:35.270
♪ I will restart my dream again ♪

00:01:35.270 --> 00:01:37.060
♪ Even if it's dangerous ♪

00:01:37.220 --> 00:01:42.270
♪ I will keep marching and get my crown back ♪

00:01:42.270 --> 00:01:45.680
♪ Put on my armor and step to the unknown future ♪

00:01:46.060 --> 00:01:50.850
♪ Hold on to my light on the road together with you ♪

00:01:50.850 --> 00:01:51.930
♪ becomes the power that supports me ♪

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:55.520
♪ The morning light that burns in my heart ♪

00:01:55.560 --> 00:01:57.890
♪ will blossom at dawn ♪

00:01:58.180 --> 00:02:00.600
♪ Dawn of Glory on battlefield ♪

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:03.850
♪ I will show you my edge ♪

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:12.390
<b>Boss of Excellent Era</b>

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:17.830
Did you hear that?

00:02:18.370 --> 00:02:21.580
Lord Grim is in cahoots with Deception.

00:02:21.580 --> 00:02:23.250
They are the shame of Glory.

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:25.540
Seriously?

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:28.830
Didn't they say Lord Grim is actually Ye Qiu?

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:31.080
He's not gonna go that low to do scrap-picking, is he?

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:32.040
= Wanted =
(Lord Grim, Deception)

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:33.120
Sure as a gun!

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:35.410
Didn't you see the Three Elite Guilds
put him on the wanted list?

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:36.350
They spent a lot of money on him.

00:02:36.350 --> 00:02:37.700
<b>Deception, Class: Ninja, Kill reward: 39999
Lord Grim, Class: Unspecialized, Kill reward: 39999</b>

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:39.200
That's a big reward.

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:40.700
<b>Lord Grim, Class: Unspecialized, Kill reward: 39999
Deception, Class: Ninja, Kill reward: 39999</b>

00:02:40.700 --> 00:02:43.040
It's about 500 bucks.

00:02:43.040 --> 00:02:43.950
<b>Lord Grim, Class: Unspecialized, Kill reward: 39999
Deception, Class: Ninja, Kill reward: 39999</b>

00:02:43.950 --> 00:02:46.000
I guess we just have to kill him for the greater good then.

00:02:46.910 --> 00:02:48.200
This is so not about knocking down the scrap-pickers.

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:49.660
They are aiming at you.

00:02:49.660 --> 00:02:50.950
So that you can't continue to level-up.

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:52.790
It's a big deal.

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:54.120
1,500 bucks.

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:57.200
I need materials to upgrade
Thousand Chance Umbrella to level 50.

00:02:57.200 --> 00:02:58.620
I can really use that money to be honest.

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:01.080
Are you out of your mind?

00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:02.830
500 bucks for one kill.

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:04.500
One level down after five kills.

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:06.120
One level is 2,500 yuan

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:08.580
A full level account will have 70 levels.

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:09.500
That is...

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:10.290
175,000 bucks.

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:11.870
That's right.

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:14.290
I can transfer my items to another Unspecialized account.

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:16.830
Lord Grim is then nothing but
an empty account worth 175,000.

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:19.500
Is just that there's no Unspecialized account on sale.

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:20.370
You, you, you...

00:03:20.790 --> 00:03:21.830
You're being serious?

00:03:22.450 --> 00:03:22.870
Wait.

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:24.910
Loulan Slash is wanted as well.

00:03:24.910 --> 00:03:26.120
We are on the list together.

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:27.540
All we need are five side accounts.

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:29.120
It'll be worth the trouble.

00:03:30.370 --> 00:03:31.580
Seriously?

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:36.830
The joint declaration of the major guilds, saw that?
Lord Grim

00:03:36.830 --> 00:03:37.060
Lord Grim

00:03:38.410 --> 00:03:39.250
Yeah.

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:41.660
We brothers are only worth 100 each.

00:03:41.910 --> 00:03:43.250
You worth more than all the rest of us together.

00:03:43.250 --> 00:03:44.160
I don't like that.

00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:46.160
Don't be.

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:47.660
I come up with a way to make some money.

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:48.790
Are you interested?

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:51.410
I'll trade mine accounts with
the five side accounts you got.

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:52.950
We can split the reward once we have them.

00:03:58.660 --> 00:03:59.830
I don't need yours.

00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:01.000
You can have the five side accounts if you want.

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:01.910
This amount of money...

00:04:01.910 --> 00:04:02.790
I don't really care.

00:04:04.250 --> 00:04:04.950
Thank you so very much.

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:08.410
Talk about being low.

00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:10.740
But you have to actually kill to get the money.

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:15.120
You want to make that money, you will
have to kill that five accounts to level 0.

00:04:15.370 --> 00:04:16.120
That's gonna look so obvious.

00:04:16.830 --> 00:04:18.410
That's why I need help.

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:20.620
I know a studio who can fix this.

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:21.770
There's an old friend of mine.

00:04:21.770 --> 00:04:22.080
<b>Studio of Qiang
There's an old friend of mine.</b>

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:23.410
Maybe he can help.
<b>Studio of Qiang</b>

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:24.600
<b>Studio of Qiang</b>

00:04:25.350 --> 00:04:28.570
(Excellent Era)

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:34.290
Hello, is your reward still on?
<b>Studio of Qiang</b>

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:34.470
<b>Studio of Qiang</b>

00:04:36.620 --> 00:04:38.410
I'm here to receive the money.

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:39.670
(From Qiang-01.avi)

00:04:43.640 --> 00:04:47.390
Welcome to Studio of Qiang

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:57.950
Got problems? No worries.

00:04:57.950 --> 00:05:00.120
Studio of Qiang is here to help.

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:07.660
Most professional.

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:08.870
Best offer.

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:11.660
Our studio is worthy of your trust.

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:17.000
Our studio will solve all your problems.

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:18.040
If it's on Glory...

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:20.120
What the heck is it?

00:05:22.450 --> 00:05:23.700
Three hours?

00:05:24.330 --> 00:05:27.160
Video from your studio, why is it so long?

00:05:31.370 --> 00:05:33.040
Well, it's 104 kills.

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:36.160
How many?

00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:37.250
104 kills.

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:38.660
I think I got then quite clear on tape.

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:39.500
This is another one.

00:05:39.500 --> 00:05:40.700
112 kills.

00:05:40.700 --> 00:05:41.660
You got one more?

00:05:41.660 --> 00:05:43.160
There are ten video files.

00:05:43.160 --> 00:05:45.290
1500 kills in total.

00:05:45.290 --> 00:05:46.660
We're still on it.

00:05:46.660 --> 00:05:48.120
1500 kills?

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:49.830
That is...

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:51.750
150,000 bucks.

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:53.410
You need my bank account or QR Code?

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:55.100
Five people.

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:57.250
60 levels down in one week.

00:05:58.160 --> 00:05:59.790
This is cheating in broad daylight.

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:04.500
But, we don't have a proof.

00:06:05.700 --> 00:06:07.410
Five side accounts from Heavenly Sword.

00:06:07.660 --> 00:06:09.410
Think I really can't see it's Heavenly Sword behind others?

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:11.870
I'm afraid there's more to this.

00:06:12.200 --> 00:06:14.450
Well, that 150 thousand.

00:06:16.370 --> 00:06:16.830
Just give it to him.

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:18.410
Take the reward off first.

00:06:20.160 --> 00:06:22.580
So that the those ill-intentioned won't get to us.

00:06:23.100 --> 00:06:25.900
(Lord Grim, Deception, Filthy Rich, North Guest, Cloud Sigh)

00:06:28.040 --> 00:06:30.660
Master, you really got me this time.

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:35.120
All Guilds know that those accounts
are from us Heavenly Sword.

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:36.540
You made 150,000.

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:38.450
I was the one who got trashed.

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:42.040
Just tell them it was me.

00:06:46.080 --> 00:06:48.200
Anyway, they've decided to pin it on me.

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:49.410
I don't want to do the explanation.

00:06:49.410 --> 00:06:50.120
Let it be.

00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:56.080
The money has come through!

00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:57.700
Great.

00:06:58.250 --> 00:07:01.200
Just like I said, you can have
the money for the two accounts.

00:07:01.950 --> 00:07:04.910
The rest of the money, you can
buy me the materials in that list.

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:06.310
Be on it.

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:13.790
What the heck?

00:07:13.790 --> 00:07:15.040
Do they even know how to play?

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:23.620
Boss.

00:07:23.910 --> 00:07:26.160
It's such a brilliant move to
not relay Excellent Era's match.

00:07:26.160 --> 00:07:27.370
You save some of their dignity.

00:07:27.370 --> 00:07:27.790
What happened?

00:07:29.250 --> 00:07:30.830
Excellent Era lost again.

00:07:31.830 --> 00:07:33.700
Unbelievable.

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:36.200
Excellent Era lost to Thunderclap with a 1-9 home defeat.

00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:38.580
Captain Sun Xiang was not at his best today.

00:07:42.160 --> 00:07:46.500
If I have to be mean, the team performance of Excellent Era was a disaster.

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:49.540
Captain Xiao Shiqin of Thunderclap,

00:07:49.540 --> 00:07:51.250
what do you think of Excellent Era's performance tonight?

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:55.370
Well, Su Mucheng has been stable.

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:59.040
As for the other players, maybe
they have some kind of a situation.

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:03.790
Zhou Zekai succeeded in the one on three combat.

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:06.630
Got two points in the contest for Samsara.

00:08:09.620 --> 00:08:11.040
The current score is two to three.

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:12.830
Samsara turned the tide on Excellent Era.

00:08:13.950 --> 00:08:15.910
After an ugly lost to Thunderclap,

00:08:15.910 --> 00:08:19.290
Excellent Era's captain Sun Xiang lost again.

00:08:20.250 --> 00:08:23.870
If they lose again, Excellent Era's ranking will drop by another place.

00:08:24.330 --> 00:08:24.870
Yes.

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:28.080
Samsara's performance has been quite impressive this season.

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:30.080
They are about to catch up with Blue Rain.

00:08:30.620 --> 00:08:32.540
There's not much room left for Excellent Era.

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:37.000
Now, let's congratulate Samsara on their victory.

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:45.000
The once triple-crowned Excellent Era,

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:47.370
is now on the verge of being out.

00:08:47.370 --> 00:08:49.120
They played like shit.

00:08:49.120 --> 00:08:52.160
Make you want to ask, what's wrong with Excellent Era?

00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:55.370
(Excellent Era)

00:09:00.170 --> 00:09:01.750
We want Captain Ye Qiu!

00:09:03.370 --> 00:09:06.080
If Excellent Era continues to like this,
will they really be out?

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:07.330
I don't know.

00:09:14.050 --> 00:09:18.470
(Happy Net Cafe)

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:26.330
Welcome.

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:27.250
Excuse me.

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:28.200
Is Ye Qiu in?

00:09:33.790 --> 00:09:34.540
Ye Xiu.

00:09:36.910 --> 00:09:37.950
There's someone for you.

00:09:38.660 --> 00:09:39.830
He seems to know you.

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:02.790
Who is he?

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:03.830
Your acquaintance?

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:09.660
Have I met him before?

00:10:09.660 --> 00:10:10.750
He looks familiar.

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:13.290
Of course you had.

00:10:13.620 --> 00:10:15.000
He is the boss of Excellent Era.

00:10:16.910 --> 00:10:18.660
I will leave you two to it.

00:10:21.870 --> 00:10:22.830
How you doing lately?

00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:23.950
Great.

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:25.890
That's what I thought.

00:10:28.120 --> 00:10:30.700
Now, do you live here?

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:33.580
With a beautiful woman like that,

00:10:33.580 --> 00:10:35.000
you're not worried that Mucheng will be mad?

00:10:37.330 --> 00:10:40.450
I mean, you're not is here
to catch up with me are you?

00:10:43.580 --> 00:10:44.250
Come back.

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:46.000
Where to?

00:10:47.540 --> 00:10:48.370
To Excellent Era.

00:10:52.400 --> 00:10:53.400
You don't have to be like that.

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:55.540
You can just join us if you want.

00:10:57.370 --> 00:10:59.450
You tried that hard to get rid of Ye Xiu.

00:10:59.450 --> 00:11:00.950
Now you want him back?

00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:03.790
Then?

00:11:04.450 --> 00:11:05.330
What do you want me back in Excellent Era?

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:06.200
Coach.

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:09.000
You want me to be the coach?

00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:11.870
Is that another move of your master plan?

00:11:12.620 --> 00:11:14.040
I'm not interested in standing on the sidelines though.

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:16.540
I prefer to be on the field.

00:11:17.160 --> 00:11:18.700
It's only temporary.

00:11:18.700 --> 00:11:19.500
Wait for a year.

00:11:19.910 --> 00:11:21.080
Then you can come right back to the scene.

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:22.580
Of course I will.

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:24.120
No matter where I stand,

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:25.750
I will always be back.

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:30.330
You don't have to be like this.

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:35.700
You and I both know,

00:11:35.950 --> 00:11:38.450
the Professional League is not like what it used to be.

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:40.950
The success of big clubs promotes the League.

00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:42.910
Celebrity players generate the most influence.

00:11:43.200 --> 00:11:44.000
These...

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:47.120
are what the League needs the most.

00:11:48.950 --> 00:11:51.580
Tactics and coordination do determine the game.

00:11:51.580 --> 00:11:53.750
But star players bring the money.

00:11:54.370 --> 00:11:55.950
Your fancy tactics,

00:11:55.950 --> 00:11:58.080
how many people you think can really understand?

00:11:58.080 --> 00:11:59.450
Those complicated coordination of yours,

00:11:59.450 --> 00:12:01.450
you think people can understand the techniques in them?

00:12:02.330 --> 00:12:03.040
No one.

00:12:04.120 --> 00:12:06.000
What do our viewers want?

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:08.040
1 on 3 in Arena Contest!

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:09.830
One man turns the table around in Team Competition.

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:11.750
That's what they love about!

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:15.830
That's the miracle they want to see.

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:19.410
Why is Zhou Zekai now called the No.1 in Glory.

00:12:19.410 --> 00:12:20.580
Because he is handsome?

00:12:20.870 --> 00:12:21.370
No.

00:12:21.870 --> 00:12:23.790
Because he got brilliant moves.

00:12:23.790 --> 00:12:24.870
The way our audiences see it,

00:12:24.870 --> 00:12:27.450
the bigger and more stunning
the moves get, the more difficult they are.

00:12:29.750 --> 00:12:32.120
You might go again like, this is superficial.

00:12:32.620 --> 00:12:35.700
But people love superficial.

00:12:36.910 --> 00:12:38.410
You didn't think much of the Dragon Raising Its Head.

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:42.330
But fans take it as your irreplaceable signature move.

00:12:42.750 --> 00:12:44.950
Only Ye Qiu can use Dragon Raising Its Head.

00:12:49.720 --> 00:12:53.350
Ye Qiu, Ye Qiu, Ye Qiu!
(One Autumn Leaf)

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:55.160
When you don't use it anymore,

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:57.330
people will think you're going down.

00:12:57.620 --> 00:12:59.790
When you used it in the All Star Game,

00:12:59.790 --> 00:13:01.790
you lit the whole crowd on fire in an instant.

00:13:04.120 --> 00:13:04.660
All of this,

00:13:05.410 --> 00:13:06.950
I don't think you can't see it.

00:13:09.410 --> 00:13:10.290
You're right.

00:13:11.660 --> 00:13:14.120
But, these are simply not what I want.

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:17.000
So what do you want?

00:13:20.620 --> 00:13:23.200
What I want is just victory.

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:24.750
You...!

00:13:26.870 --> 00:13:30.410
You think you can win back the glories in the past?

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:31.750
I'm trying.

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:34.000
You can't.

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:36.000
You're so sure of it.

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:37.950
Let's just wait and see.

00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:39.080
OK.

00:13:39.620 --> 00:13:40.830
We'll see.

00:13:42.040 --> 00:13:45.370
Before that, you might wanna make sure
Excellent Era not to be out first.

00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:51.120
Even if Excellent Era is out this time,
we can be right back to the League in a year.

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:55.580
We look to the future, not the past.

00:13:56.580 --> 00:14:01.330
The stone that gets in our way
will only get kicked away with no mercy.

00:14:02.290 --> 00:14:04.620
About that, you did do a great job.

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:08.950
Goodbye.

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:09.790
Be my guess.

00:14:11.290 --> 00:14:14.580
The League won't go back to the past.

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:15.330
I know.

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:17.700
But I'm getting old.

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:19.540
I'm too lazy to move forward.

00:14:20.450 --> 00:14:21.370
You...

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:25.750
You could have had a perfect ending.

00:14:27.250 --> 00:14:30.370
Whether my ending is perfect or not, depends on me.

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:54.620
We've been friends before.

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:57.120
So I can promise you one last thing.

00:14:58.350 --> 00:15:00.300
Even if you want to transfer One Autumn Leaf.

00:15:01.620 --> 00:15:02.780
That would be expensive.

00:15:03.370 --> 00:15:05.950
Just say your offer, and I will say yes.

00:15:07.410 --> 00:15:10.200
God-level account has never been out on the transfer market.

00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:13.950
One Autumn Leaf is going to worth at least 20 million.

00:15:16.370 --> 00:15:16.870
Well then,

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:19.290
I want Dancing Rain.

00:15:26.450 --> 00:15:28.020
The King's Avatar 2

00:15:31.370 --> 00:15:34.370
Mr. Tao, unless you get us what we want,
otherwise there won't be no deal.

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:40.120
As long as Ye Qiu refuses to do advertisement,

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:42.160
even though Excellent Era has double crown in hand,

00:15:42.160 --> 00:15:44.540
to those sponsors, we still mean nothing.

00:15:45.700 --> 00:15:48.870
If we can sign a new man with more business value...

00:15:48.870 --> 00:15:49.580
Brother Tao.

00:15:54.250 --> 00:15:55.500
Mucheng, you're here today.

00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:57.250
I'm here for the Playoffs.

00:15:57.250 --> 00:15:59.000
I want to see it live.

00:15:59.750 --> 00:16:01.160
So you know about Glory?

00:16:01.870 --> 00:16:02.790
Not just know about.

00:16:03.250 --> 00:16:04.660
She is actually really good.

00:16:06.540 --> 00:16:07.450
What's your class?

00:16:07.870 --> 00:16:08.580
Launcher.

00:16:09.290 --> 00:16:10.000
Launcher?

00:16:11.750 --> 00:16:12.750
She is Dancing Rain.

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:14.290
Well done!

00:16:14.540 --> 00:16:16.370
Excellent Era's rookie Dancing Rain

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:19.410
came for One Autumn Leaf at critical moment and winning the game.

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:22.250
Congratulations on Excellent Era for its best dual.

00:16:24.700 --> 00:16:25.290
OK.

00:16:26.120 --> 00:16:27.200
My word is good as gold.

00:16:31.160 --> 00:16:31.660
Thank you.

00:16:35.540 --> 00:16:36.620
I didn't expect

00:16:37.500 --> 00:16:41.120
you would choose Dancing Rain over One Autumn Leaf.

00:16:41.410 --> 00:16:42.720
I make my own decisions.

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:45.290
Take care of yourself then.

00:16:46.410 --> 00:16:46.950
Bye.

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:01.000
Ye Xiu.

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:04.910
You used to really tight, aren't you?

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:08.950
(Excellent Era)

00:17:09.200 --> 00:17:12.370
You just go practice, leave the rest to brother Tao.

00:17:12.370 --> 00:17:13.620
(Excellent Era Net Cafe)

00:17:13.660 --> 00:17:15.830
Don't worry, I just put the first floor on lease.

00:17:15.830 --> 00:17:17.160
We will get it back later.

00:17:19.790 --> 00:17:23.500
The champion of the first Glory Professional League is born.

00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:24.790
Excellent Era!

00:17:37.080 --> 00:17:38.000
Where are you going?

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:39.290
To do my level-up.

00:17:39.790 --> 00:17:40.370
You coming?

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:43.250
Sure.

00:17:52.140 --> 00:17:54.800
(Level 55 Leveling Area - Milo Ancient Ruins)

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:05.390
Run!

00:18:05.390 --> 00:18:06.060
What?

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:10.000
We've been ambushed at our log-in spot.

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:24.620
-- Who are they?
-- Don't know yet.

00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:26.500
But they got to us at the very minute when we logged in.

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:27.870
It's gotta be a planned ambush.

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:29.000
Deliberately targeted at us.

00:18:30.410 --> 00:18:31.750
But these people are just average level.

00:18:32.160 --> 00:18:33.620
Except for the commander.

00:18:33.910 --> 00:18:35.790
He can pinch my exit every single time.

00:18:38.120 --> 00:18:39.700
Even you find it difficult?

00:18:39.700 --> 00:18:41.660
Then he has to be a pro.

00:18:41.660 --> 00:18:44.250
If we can find the commander, get rid of him.

00:18:44.750 --> 00:18:45.410
Where is he?

00:18:45.410 --> 00:18:46.790
He disappeared in a blink.

00:18:47.080 --> 00:18:48.580
The rest are just nothing.

00:18:49.540 --> 00:18:50.700
Where did he go?

00:18:50.700 --> 00:18:51.790
I'll take a look over there.

00:18:53.870 --> 00:18:55.290
Stay at your positions.

00:18:56.790 --> 00:18:57.910
He's coming.

00:19:14.700 --> 00:19:16.120
I don't think the commander is in them.

00:19:17.950 --> 00:19:21.000
You mean, none of the eight is the commander?

00:19:22.910 --> 00:19:25.370
Maybe this guy is only good at commanding,

00:19:25.370 --> 00:19:27.290
he's not so good at close combat.

00:19:27.790 --> 00:19:28.410
Maybe.

00:19:32.870 --> 00:19:33.830
They're back again.

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:34.500
Pain in the ass.

00:19:35.330 --> 00:19:36.160
I can revive now.

00:19:36.160 --> 00:19:37.410
Wait for me, I'll be right with you.

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:51.540
He can fly?

00:19:51.540 --> 00:19:52.830
What kind of weapon is this?

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:07.870
Got ya!

00:20:14.450 --> 00:20:15.790
Old Wei?

00:20:41.180 --> 00:20:43.970
♪ If you can't see the sky with your head up ♪

00:20:45.390 --> 00:20:49.100
♪ Then look down and focus on where you're heading ♪

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:53.930
♪ We all know that we don't want to bury our dreams ♪

00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:56.100
♪ Step back for the next take-off ♪

00:20:58.520 --> 00:21:00.720
♪ All channels are reconnected ♪

00:21:01.060 --> 00:21:02.680
♪ I remember you said you would wait ♪

00:21:02.930 --> 00:21:04.810
♪ Fine melody under my fingertips ♪

00:21:04.810 --> 00:21:06.970
♪ Perfect performance in digital world ♪

00:21:09.680 --> 00:21:11.680
♪ Brand-new melody, brand-new you and me ♪

00:21:11.720 --> 00:21:14.970
♪ Our passion will support us to the end ♪

00:21:14.970 --> 00:21:18.220
♪ Light the fire in you ♪

00:21:18.220 --> 00:21:20.350
♪ Shine away the weakness in dark ♪

00:21:20.350 --> 00:21:22.060
♪ You can laugh at me, you can look down on me ♪

00:21:22.060 --> 00:21:23.850
♪ They would only drive me further ♪

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:27.100
♪ Take record of our pulses ♪

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:31.100
♪ All those provocations ♪

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:33.270
♪ They will only firm my steps ♪
